What is AWS CloudWatch?
It’s like a health monitor for your cloud infrastructure. Whether it's EC2, Lambda, S3, or any AWS service — CloudWatch keeps an eye on it.

📌 Key Things You Can Do with CloudWatch (Even as a Beginner!):

✅ Monitor CPU usage on EC2
✅ Set up Alarms to alert you when something goes wrong
✅ View Logs from your applications (real-time!)
✅ Create Dashboards to visualize metrics
✅ Use custom metrics for deeper insights
